er?"}, {"source_id": "M48", "message_number": 48, "role": "assistant", "content": "That's also included. We'll inspect and replace if needed."}, {"source_id": "M49", "message_number": 49, "role": "user", "content": "Do you check other fluids too?"}, {"source_id": "M50", "message_number": 50, "role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, we top off all fluids - coolant, brake fluid, power steering, windshield washer."}, {"source_id": "M51", "message_number": 51, "role": "user", "content": "What about the battery?"}, {"source_id": "M52", "message_number": 52, "role": "assistant", "content": "We test the battery and charging system as part of our complimentary inspection."}, {"source_id": "M53", "message_number": 53, "role": "user", "content": "Mine's probably original from 2019."}, {"source_id": "M54", "message_number": 54, "role": "assistant", "content": "So about 5 years old. That's getting to replacement age. We'll test it and let you know."}, {"source_id": "M55", "message_number": 55, "role": "user", "content": "How much for a new battery if I need one?"}, {"source_id": "M56", "message_number": 56, "role": "assistant", "content": "Batteries for your Accord run $159-189 depending on the brand, includes installation."}, {"source_id": "M57", "message_number": 57, "role": "user", "content": "Okay. Do you offer any warranties?"}, {"source_id": "M58", "message_number": 58, "role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, our service comes with a 12-month/12,000-mile warranty on parts and labor."}, {"source_id": "M59", "message_number": 59, "role": "user", "content": "That's reassuring. Oh, I also have a Tesla that needs tire rotation."}, {"source_id": "M60", "message_number": 60, "role": "assistant", "content": "We can definitely do that. What model Tesla?"}, {"source_id": "M61", "message_number": 61, "role": "user", "content": "2023 Model 3 Long Range."}, {"source_id": "M62", "message_number": 62, "role": "assistant", "content": "Current mileage on the Tesla?"}, {"source_id": "M63", "mes