ening."}, {"source_id": "M93", "message_number": 93, "role": "user", "content": "Great. See you Friday morning!"}, {"source_id": "M94", "message_number": 94, "role": "assistant", "content": "See you then, Mr. Chen. Have a great Thanksgiving!"}]}

